<title>DENMARK: Nordic Investment Bank raises amount on 4pct bond.</title>
<headline>Nordic Investment Bank raises amount on 4pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nordic Investment Bank (NIB) raised an existing 700 million crown, four percent bond offer to 800 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The bond matures in 2002 and the lead manager is Jyske Bank, the statement said. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
</text>
